{'symbol': 'ED', 'date': '2021-04-15 16:30:00', 'title': 'CON EDISON DECLARES COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK, APRIL 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CONSOLIDATED EDISON, INC. (CON EDISON) (NYSE: ED) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF 77.5 CENTS A SHARE ON ITS COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE JUNE 15, 2021 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 19, 2021. CONSOLIDATED EDISON, INC. IS ONE OF THE NATION'S LARGEST INVESTOR-OWNED ENERGY-DELIVERY COMPANIES, WITH APPROXIMATELY $12 BILLION IN ANNUAL REVENUES AND $63 BILLION IN ASSETS."}